  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 6 is the longest at Vista del Camino at 317 feet — a par 3 that plays along the lake and gives the open course its one real water decision. It's the hole that turns a casual park round into something to concentrate on, and the one the regulars talk about after every visit.",
  "localTips": "Four pin layouts stretch the course from 4,723 to 7,250 feet — the long pins are a genuine marathon. The lakes are in play on seven holes. Free to play, very cart friendly, accessible at all times. Note: the park has been undergoing construction — check current access.",
